stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Home
    state "首页：选择图片" as Home
    state "读取与分析原图" as Analyzing
    state "裁切设置与预览" as Settings
    state "调整切线" as CutEditor
    state "生成切片" as Processing
    state "切片结果（可选择）" as Results
    state "源文件不可访问" as FileError
    state "切片失败（可重试）" as ProcessError
    Home --> Analyzing: 相册选择或外部分享
    Analyzing --> Settings: 当前图片分析成功
    Analyzing --> FileError: 无权限或无法读取
    FileError --> Home: 重新选择
    Analyzing --> Analyzing: 新图片取代旧加载
    Settings --> CutEditor: 点击预览/调整切线
    CutEditor --> Settings: 完成手动调整
    Settings --> Processing: 生成切片
    Processing --> Results: 成功并发出一次性导航
    Processing --> ProcessError: 处理失败
    ProcessError --> Processing: 重试
    Results --> Settings: 返回调整设置
